  "goodToKnow": "Die Leitstelle is a control or dispatch centre. In Germany, emergency calls to 112 go to the regional Integrierte Leitstelle, which dispatches fire engines and ambulances; police calls to 110 go to the Einsatzzentrale. Transport companies and power grids also have Leitstellen. From leiten (to direct) and die Stelle (post, office). Plural: die Leitstellen."
